(5640254, 819587, 46918, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I thought that this was a where''s waldo challenge. So where is Waldo???</td>', 'Sorry but I thought that this was a where''s waldo challenge. So where is Waldo???', '2009-09-08 09:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640582, 819708, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think it would be much stronger with the horizon on the bottom third line. Believe me, I''m certainly not a strong believer in thirds, but there''s a lot of dark water at the bottom of the frame that I don''t think adds much to the shot. Also, the bird flying at the top is wonderful, but seems disconnected. If you crop some off the bottom, it seems to also bring the bird back into the photo.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think it would be much stronger with the horizon on the bottom third line. Believe me, I''m certainly not a strong believer in thirds, but there''s a lot of dark water at the bottom of the frame that I don''t think adds much to the shot. Also, the bird flying at the top is wonderful, but seems disconnected. If you crop some off the bottom, it seems to also bring the bird back into the photo.', '2009-09-08 15:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
