(5641118, 818944, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait with nice contrasts and an adorable subject.  <br/>It is not, unfortunately IMO, an "otherwise person-less" photo.  The colored flower against the desat rest of the shot is clearly the main subject.  But the baby is the real story, and is in no way hidden.<br/>Very creative, and nicely done, just dnmc a bit for me.</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait with nice contrasts and an adorable subject.  It is not, unfortunately IMO, an "otherwise person-less" photo.  The colored flower against the desat rest of the shot is clearly the main subject.  But the baby is the real story, and is in no way hidden.Very creative, and nicely done, just dnmc a bit for me.', '2009-09-09 00:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
