(5645434, 819688, 70369, '<td valign="top">after coming back to this image like, 15 times, I finally saw waldo.. lol.. It would have worked more for me if the really distracting white line shooting across the entire right side of the image wasn''t there.. Also, all the blur is confusing.. I can''t tell if it''s a mistake or if it''s from multiple exposures or if it''s from motion blur.. This is a 3 for me.. I''m so very sorry if that hurts your feelings, but I''m trying to explain my low votes.... So, I''m hoping it was helpful.</td>', 'after coming back to this image like, 15 times, I finally saw waldo.. lol.. It would have worked more for me if the really distracting white line shooting across the entire right side of the image wasn''t there.. Also, all the blur is confusing.. I can''t tell if it''s a mistake or if it''s from multiple exposures or if it''s from motion blur.. This is a 3 for me.. I''m so very sorry if that hurts your feelings, but I''m trying to explain my low votes.... So, I''m hoping it was helpful.', '2009-09-13 16:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5645436, 819718, 70369, '<td valign="top">mrs voter doesn''t either.. nothing really "where''s waldo" about this one.. The center composition of the people makes it a little like a snap shot. the sunlight appears really harsh on the flowers and they just aren''t that attractive to look at. This is a 3 for me. I apologize if this hurts anyones feelings, that was not my intention. I am trying to always give an explanation for why I''m giving out any 3''s.</td>', 'mrs voter doesn''t either.. nothing really "where''s waldo" about this one.. The center composition of the people makes it a little like a snap shot. the sunlight appears really harsh on the flowers and they just aren''t that attractive to look at. This is a 3 for me. I apologize if this hurts anyones feelings, that was not my intention. I am trying to always give an explanation for why I''m giving out any 3''s.', '2009-09-13 16:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5645437, 819582, 70369, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOSH... Kay, took me like 8 views of this to figure otu where waldo is.. it''s kinda creepy looking.. now that I finally see him though, I get why his face is covered &amp; what you were going for.. He''s supposed to blend in with the fabric, right ???? The overhead composition on this isn''t my favorite. It just kinda looks like a messy bed. 4 for me. and, I''m trying to explain my lower votes so please do not let this hurt your feelings in anyway. It''s just my opinion..</td>', 'OH MY GOSH... Kay, took me like 8 views of this to figure otu where waldo is.. it''s kinda creepy looking.. now that I finally see him though, I get why his face is covered & what you were going for.. He''s supposed to blend in with the fabric, right ???? The overhead composition on this isn''t my favorite. It just kinda looks like a messy bed. 4 for me. and, I''m trying to explain my lower votes so please do not let this hurt your feelings in anyway. It''s just my opinion..', '2009-09-13 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
