(5646126, 819582, 109607, '<td valign="top">Waldo is upside down in the lower right corner. <br/>I really like monochrome photography and I was going for something original and creative.<br/>The piled sheets remind me of looking for hidden forms in clouds and looks just as comfortable and inviting to jump into! If I could have made a face in the clouds, that would have been my submission for this challenge!</td>', 'Waldo is upside down in the lower right corner. I really like monochrome photography and I was going for something original and creative.The piled sheets remind me of looking for hidden forms in clouds and looks just as comfortable and inviting to jump into! If I could have made a face in the clouds, that would have been my submission for this challenge!', '2009-09-14 01:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
