(5646550, 819587, 68947, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot!  I just couldn''t find Waldo and in taking another look at it again, I''m thinking that perhaps, it all depends on monitor resolution.  Your monitor may be brighter and therefore, more easily seen.  Perhaps, on most monitors, it came out too darkened to be able to identify or see the face in the background???  Anyways, take heart that it was a great shot and I think most voters just considered it a DNMC entry. :(</td>', 'I liked this shot!  I just couldn''t find Waldo and in taking another look at it again, I''m thinking that perhaps, it all depends on monitor resolution.  Your monitor may be brighter and therefore, more easily seen.  Perhaps, on most monitors, it came out too darkened to be able to identify or see the face in the background???  Anyways, take heart that it was a great shot and I think most voters just considered it a DNMC entry. :(', '2009-09-14 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
