(5646768, 819568, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain the score on this one.  I do see some banding in the sky on my darker of the two monitors - maybe that''s it?  Otherwise it''s a lovely fall palette of color, well composed (as always) and a very good job of hiding Waldo!</td>', 'I can''t explain the score on this one.  I do see some banding in the sky on my darker of the two monitors - maybe that''s it?  Otherwise it''s a lovely fall palette of color, well composed (as always) and a very good job of hiding Waldo!', '2009-09-14 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
