(5646827, 819582, 93576, '<td valign="top">67? ohh my gosh. well, to me photography is not only pretty lighting and perfect composition, they are tools for a good photograph also a boundary which restricts us to look beyond the obvious. Before I started judging, I played the game again for a couple of hours! It was fun and helpful. Wally is hidden with great care, tonnes of forces that can distract, confuse the player and your picture has those strategic qualities! Iwas fun going through your sheets, lol. Its very clever and original. I found Mr. Waldo whith the help of ur lighting, where theres no color, brightness was a guide and Bingo, a scary Wally! I ranked you 10, one of the best pictures of this challenge, truly original and smart. Great job!</td>', '67? ohh my gosh. well, to me photography is not only pretty lighting and perfect composition, they are tools for a good photograph also a boundary which restricts us to look beyond the obvious. Before I started judging, I played the game again for a couple of hours! It was fun and helpful. Wally is hidden with great care, tonnes of forces that can distract, confuse the player and your picture has those strategic qualities! Iwas fun going through your sheets, lol. Its very clever and original. I found Mr. Waldo whith the help of ur lighting, where theres no color, brightness was a guide and Bingo, a scary Wally! I ranked you 10, one of the best pictures of this challenge, truly original and smart. Great job!', '2009-09-14 16:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5646860, 819688, 93576, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 8, and I think its great. Dusn''t deserve to be back here and good use of the glass reflection.</td>', 'I gave it a 8, and I think its great. Dusn''t deserve to be back here and good use of the glass reflection.', '2009-09-14 16:44:13.000000', NULL, 0),
