(5647166, 819363, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat shot--it is such an interesting tangled mess, and it was a challenge to find Waldo! Yet after you found him, you had no idea how you missed him in the first place!! Wonderfully done!</td>', 'This is a really neat shot--it is such an interesting tangled mess, and it was a challenge to find Waldo! Yet after you found him, you had no idea how you missed him in the first place!! Wonderfully done!', '2009-09-14 21:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647171, 819608, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! And I think they''re hidden just fine! I like this level of waldo so much better than the ones that were next to impossible. I wonder if I would have the guts to jump. But then I thought, if everyone else was jumping off a bridge...  :D</td>', 'Fun shot! And I think they''re hidden just fine! I like this level of waldo so much better than the ones that were next to impossible. I wonder if I would have the guts to jump. But then I thought, if everyone else was jumping off a bridge...  :D', '2009-09-14 21:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647173, 819688, 103142, '<td valign="top">I found this one quite fascinating. I really couldn''t tell if the white streak was just a very bright beam, or what. But it made you look and look again. And the rest of it had such a dreamy quality, that it just pulled you in.</td>', 'I found this one quite fascinating. I really couldn''t tell if the white streak was just a very bright beam, or what. But it made you look and look again. And the rest of it had such a dreamy quality, that it just pulled you in.', '2009-09-14 21:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647175, 819720, 103142, '<td valign="top">I found this one quite fascinating, and I''m shocked that it scored so low--I gave it a 7. Very nicely done!</td>', 'I found this one quite fascinating, and I''m shocked that it scored so low--I gave it a 7. Very nicely done!', '2009-09-14 21:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647176, 819590, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised that this didn''t score higher--I thought it was an excellent job of hiding waldo. I tried hiding my son in a field of some strange, unidentifiable plant, and it''s very difficult to do! Very nicely done!</td>', 'I''m surprised that this didn''t score higher--I thought it was an excellent job of hiding waldo. I tried hiding my son in a field of some strange, unidentifiable plant, and it''s very difficult to do! Very nicely done!', '2009-09-14 21:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647179, 819568, 103142, '<td valign="top">Gothic glow? I don''t know that one... I''ll have to look it up!<br/> <br/>I love this photo--it really makes me wish I was there. I want to take a picnic and just sit out on the point and listen to the sounds. You made it very inviting!!<br/> <br/>edited to add: I forgot to look for waldo each time!! I got too interested in the spot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-14 20:39:24.</i></td>', 'Gothic glow? I don''t know that one... I''ll have to look it up! I love this photo--it really makes me wish I was there. I want to take a picnic and just sit out on the point and listen to the sounds. You made it very inviting!! edited to add: I forgot to look for waldo each time!! I got too interested in the spot!', '2009-09-14 21:38:20.000000', '2009-09-14 21:39:24.000000', 0),
(5647185, 819627, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one. I didn''t vote since I had seen it before the challenge, but each time I saw it, I liked it more. It should have done better. I find the lines interesting and the reflections fascinating. People just needed to spend a little more time reflecting :D on it!</td>', 'I really liked this one. I didn''t vote since I had seen it before the challenge, but each time I saw it, I liked it more. It should have done better. I find the lines interesting and the reflections fascinating. People just needed to spend a little more time reflecting :D on it!', '2009-09-14 21:42:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647188, 819556, 103142, '<td valign="top">Haha!! I couldn''t find her, but I believed there was a person somewhere in there!<br/> <br/>I love the processing on this one. I''m not a fan of borders, but I actually think that it went very well with this photo. It made it feel like I was in a European flower market.</td>', 'Haha!! I couldn''t find her, but I believed there was a person somewhere in there! I love the processing on this one. I''m not a fan of borders, but I actually think that it went very well with this photo. It made it feel like I was in a European flower market.', '2009-09-14 21:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647233, 819247, 30608, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if this was your photo Sandy, knowing you were in Oregon. Congratulations for your top 10 finish. Very Beautiful!!!</td>', 'I was wondering if this was your photo Sandy, knowing you were in Oregon. Congratulations for your top 10 finish. Very Beautiful!!!', '2009-09-14 22:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647255, 819702, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Poor sucker didn''t notice the meteor that caused the catastrophic airburst off in the distance. ;-) Great job - congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>There was one other minor detail the poor kayaker missed as well...thanks to advances in modern post-processing techniques, all is revealed!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=821333" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/79720/120/821333.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/79720/120/821333.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/79720/120/821333.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Poor sucker didn''t notice the meteor that caused the catastrophic airburst off in the distance. ;-) Great job - congrats!  There was one other minor detail the poor kayaker missed as well...thanks to advances in modern post-processing techniques, all is revealed! ', '2009-09-14 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647271, 819702, 64446, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10!</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10!', '2009-09-14 23:22:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647273, 819699, 64446, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a strong finish and a beautiful image!</td>', 'Congrats on a strong finish and a beautiful image!', '2009-09-14 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647295, 819145, 90495, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot from the get go. It''s not only the processing but the child''s pose and angle from which we see him. The space all around him makes him look smaller than he is and adds to the feeling of being lost that I get when I view this.<br/> <br/>A well deserved red.</td>', 'I liked this shot from the get go. It''s not only the processing but the child''s pose and angle from which we see him. The space all around him makes him look smaller than he is and adds to the feeling of being lost that I get when I view this. A well deserved red.', '2009-09-14 23:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647297, 819713, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice one.</td>', 'Nice one.', '2009-09-14 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647323, 819582, 109607, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I can''t find waldo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>For an art critic like yourself, I''m surprised. That gets me thinking though, how many other subtle details have your eyes missed in other photographs that you do not like just because you didn''t get it because you didn''t see an important detail in the photo. hmmm <br/> <br/>Maybe you were voting too fast? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well said and thank you!</td>', 'Originally posted by Jac: Originally posted by posthumous: I can''t find waldo.   For an art critic like yourself, I''m surprised. That gets me thinking though, how many other subtle details have your eyes missed in other photographs that you do not like just because you didn''t get it because you didn''t see an important detail in the photo. hmmm  Maybe you were voting too fast?   Well said and thank you!', '2009-09-15 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647325, 819582, 109607, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tan45:</b></div><hr/><i> 67? ohh my gosh. well, to me photography is not only pretty lighting and perfect composition, they are tools for a good photograph also a boundary which restricts us to look beyond the obvious. Before I started judging, I played the game again for a couple of hours! It was fun and helpful. Wally is hidden with great care, tonnes of forces that can distract, confuse the player and your picture has those strategic qualities! Iwas fun going through your sheets, lol. Its very clever and original. I found Mr. Waldo whith the help of ur lighting, where theres no color, brightness was a guide and Bingo, a scary Wally! I ranked you 10, one of the best pictures of this challenge, truly original and smart. Great job! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You got EXACTLY what I was going for, thank you for seeing it and thank you for commenting :)</td>', 'Originally posted by tan45: 67? ohh my gosh. well, to me photography is not only pretty lighting and perfect composition, they are tools for a good photograph also a boundary which restricts us to look beyond the obvious. Before I started judging, I played the game again for a couple of hours! It was fun and helpful. Wally is hidden with great care, tonnes of forces that can distract, confuse the player and your picture has those strategic qualities! Iwas fun going through your sheets, lol. Its very clever and original. I found Mr. Waldo whith the help of ur lighting, where theres no color, brightness was a guide and Bingo, a scary Wally! I ranked you 10, one of the best pictures of this challenge, truly original and smart. Great job!   You got EXACTLY what I was going for, thank you for seeing it and thank you for commenting :)', '2009-09-15 00:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5647541, 819713, 102386, '<td valign="top">This is so brilliant. I took ages to find Waldo. Well done.</td>', 'This is so brilliant. I took ages to find Waldo. Well done.', '2009-09-15 04:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
